{
    "word": "holist",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e302c511-a6bf-3ed5-adcb-5265d88cb526",
                "word": "holist",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "aba4a68f-3e06-33de-800c-be2aa0f9814b",
                        "entry_id": "e302c511-a6bf-3ed5-adcb-5265d88cb526",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That concentrates on forming an overview of the topic."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "faf903ed-bf34-43fe-ba0a-8d3cc1fe28e2",
                                "sense_id": "aba4a68f-3e06-33de-800c-be2aa0f9814b",
                                "text": "Pask suggests that these strategies reflect basic learning styles; holist strategies reflect a comprehension learning style and serialist strategies an operation learning style."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "87ef08f1-f921-4210-805a-d7186c08f33d",
                                "sense_id": "aba4a68f-3e06-33de-800c-be2aa0f9814b",
                                "text": "Pask described the two strategies as 'holist' and 'serialist'.[…]Learners who adopt a holist strategy (described as comprehension learners) like to get an overview of a topic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f10aca0-f5eb-4a25-bebb-92d1a88a2af9",
                                "sense_id": "aba4a68f-3e06-33de-800c-be2aa0f9814b",
                                "text": "The serialist/holist cognitive style is a measure of a bipolar information-processing strategy that describes the way that learners select and represent information (Pask, 1976; Pask & Scott, 1972)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "0033f9e3-704e-35a5-b51a-2a5bf323a019",
                "word": "holist",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "3629a4e0-fdca-4af7-a7db-5f90600065a4",
                        "entry_id": "0033f9e3-704e-35a5-b51a-2a5bf323a019",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "holists"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d88188c2-b104-326f-8347-c7894aaea1de",
                        "entry_id": "0033f9e3-704e-35a5-b51a-2a5bf323a019",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A believer in, or practitioner of, holism; one who believes that a topic of study cannot be fully understood by studying the parts, or who studies by considering the whole."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "893c1259-486e-4ffe-b8bc-acbe34fd80dc",
                                "sense_id": "d88188c2-b104-326f-8347-c7894aaea1de",
                                "text": "The holists generally claimed that the variety of the clinical pictures was not intrinsic to aphasia, although it was recognized that aphasic patients differ in many respects, not only the severity of the language disorder."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9acf0cd-c3fd-3739-b075-0425f5b82ad9",
                        "entry_id": "0033f9e3-704e-35a5-b51a-2a5bf323a019",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who advocates studying society as a whole, and who consistently interprets the actions of individuals in that context."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6f272cc-ee1b-47ef-bf6a-53ca39b285d0",
                                "sense_id": "a9acf0cd-c3fd-3739-b075-0425f5b82ad9",
                                "text": "Holism is more eclectic in its methods; for most holists, rigor means reconstructing the meaning of an action in the subject's own terms, and interpreting it in light of a richly detailed cultural, social, and historical context."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b67799cc-5b64-494e-8f88-f84ff8c8addd",
                                "sense_id": "a9acf0cd-c3fd-3739-b075-0425f5b82ad9",
                                "text": "By contrast, the holists, like Emile Durkheim, regard individual action as only a reaction to pressures exerted by society as a whole: they are right in stressing the social embeddedness of individual action."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "722d488f-20d8-32d5-aff7-ae072ba6ee77",
                        "entry_id": "0033f9e3-704e-35a5-b51a-2a5bf323a019",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who prefers to learn by forming an overview of the topic."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aead7bea-6985-4895-af02-5d634695bea4",
                                "sense_id": "722d488f-20d8-32d5-aff7-ae072ba6ee77",
                                "text": "Those subjects using a serialist strategy tended to proceed in a step-by-step manner, whereas the holists adopted a more global approach to what was to be learned."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffa975c9-4443-4d23-9c98-3a293d09ef94",
                                "sense_id": "722d488f-20d8-32d5-aff7-ae072ba6ee77",
                                "text": "They^([serialists]) learn rules, methods and details more readily than the holists."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d1ee918-eb7a-4f06-b32e-bc34f067079f",
                                "sense_id": "722d488f-20d8-32d5-aff7-ae072ba6ee77",
                                "text": "Holists use a global, thematic approach to learning by concentrating first on building broad descriptions.[…]The holist then uses complex links to relate mutileveled information."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8495dacc-fbeb-4ada-8f91-4f1bf1f5978e",
                        "source_entry_id": "0033f9e3-704e-35a5-b51a-2a5bf323a019",
                        "source_sense_description": "believer in, or practitioner of, holism",
                        "target_lang_word": "holista",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b894e360-aabd-4253-b064-0958065f5005",
                        "source_entry_id": "0033f9e3-704e-35a5-b51a-2a5bf323a019",
                        "source_sense_description": "believer in, or practitioner of, holism",
                        "target_lang_word": "holiste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "holiste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5316530-174f-33ab-a05b-e78269e3cf10",
                                        "entry_id": "10073d7e-9cc3-3eb0-bd28-b6be6bb4d3f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Holistique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e794024a-71c7-4d0f-8048-71ec0701428e",
                                                "sense_id": "e5316530-174f-33ab-a05b-e78269e3cf10",
                                                "text": "S'il est moins original, le holisme français est aussi moins néfaste. Tout en étant largement conservateur, il ne fait pratiquement pas montre de cet esprit d'exclusion et de racisme qui transparaît chez de nombreux penseurs holistes allemands."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "holiste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99423353-27d4-33d8-bb07-5ad4b3900d6e",
                                        "entry_id": "ebe31f3c-423e-37d5-b252-87c8d9903f77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui ou celle qui professe le holisme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81610bce-cad0-4419-b9dc-a24063846a27",
                                                "sense_id": "99423353-27d4-33d8-bb07-5ad4b3900d6e",
                                                "text": "Il faut dire que c’est une mésinterprétation de Mauss, car ce dernier n’est ni un individualiste pur, ni un holiste dur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3f77ec9-84b4-4363-a2fa-5e2b456912d1",
                                                "sense_id": "99423353-27d4-33d8-bb07-5ad4b3900d6e",
                                                "text": "Certains holistes, comme Leriche, deviendront pétainistes et exerceront des responsabilités sous le régime de Vichy. Mais, en mettant de côté le cas d'Alexis Carrel, les grandes figures du holisme sortiront intactes de la période de Vichy et de l'Occupation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
